# CSIR – Indian Institute of Toxicology Research (CSIR-IITR)

## Research Training

### Duration

January 2023 – May 2023

---

# Project

Graphene Oxide–Protein Interaction Studies for Biosensing Applications

---

# Overview

Completed a research internship at CSIR–Indian Institute of Toxicology Research under the supervision of senior scientists, focusing on graphene oxide–protein interaction studies for biosensing applications.

---

# Objectives

- Investigate graphene oxide–protein interactions
- Evaluate biosensing applications
- Analyze experimental observations
- Interpret scientific data

---

# Laboratory Techniques

- UV–Visible Spectroscopy
- Sample Preparation
- Protein Interaction Studies
- Biosensor Analysis

---

# Skills Developed

- Experimental Research
- Scientific Documentation
- Data Interpretation
- Literature Review
- Laboratory Practice

---

# Outcome

The work contributed to a peer-reviewed scientific publication in *Carbon Trends*.

